    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "A person who is responsible for the provision of goods or services under the Commonwealth contract must provide those goods or services.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The mandatory nature of a contracted service provider's responsibility is to provide goods or services.";
