    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Consequence of a contracted service provider's responsibility";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "If a person is responsible for the provision of goods or services under the Commonwealth contract, then they must provide those goods or services.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The consequence of a contracted service provider's responsibility is that they must provide goods or services.";
